Package: bioana
Title: Analyse Biodes Experiments, Simulated or Real
Version: 0.11.1
Authors@R: person("Nirwan", "Tandukar", email = "tandukar.nirwan@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads a Biodes design folder (study_spec.json, field_layout.csv,
    sample metadata) and the data listed in its data_manifest.json, and runs
    the analysis each data type calls for with the model the design calls for:
    the primary outcome (continuous, binary, count, ordinal, survival), feature
    counts (RNA-seq, small RNA, microbiome, ChIP and ATAC peaks), bisulfite and
    array methylation, and m6A MeRIP-seq. When the folder comes from Simitall
    and carries the simulated truth, every analysis is scored against it.
    Each analysis calls a published package chosen by rule tables (DESeq2,
    edgeR, limma, dream, DSS, lme4, glmmTMB, rrBLUP, GAPIT, ...) and records
    the package, version, exact call, model, test and assumptions.
